      198          F-deliv-subj-name:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      199   ASSIGN
      200          F-deliv-type-name:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      201   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
